    <node id="John Smith">
      <data key="d0">John Smith</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">John Smith is a multifaceted individual with both professional and personal connections. Professionally, he has held various roles, including serving as the CEO of ABC Corporation, where he demonstrated leadership skills. He also worked as a software engineer at XYZ Corporation in New York City and across multiple locations in the United States, showcasing his adaptability and flexibility.

In addition to his professional life, John Smith is known for his personal connections. As an author and novelist, he has roots in New York City, where he resides with his wife Emily. The couple's international connections were showcased during a notable event - their visit to Paris on January 15th, 1995. 

John Smith's connections extend beyond his professional roles, also tying him to the field of finance. Despite some discrepancies regarding his identity or relationships, these appear to arise from limited information available on certain aspects rather than multiple individuals sharing the same name.

It is clear that John Smith is a complex individual with a wide range of professional and personal connections, linking him to various domains, including finance and software engineering.</data>
