      <data key="d0">Company</data>
      <data key="d1">name</data>
      <data key="d2">The Company, specifically referred to as ABC Inc., DEF Ltd., and GHI Co. in various contexts, is a technology company based primarily in New York, with additional operations or presence in the UK.

A closer examination reveals that while these names are used interchangeably, they may refer to distinct entities within the same corporate group or different subsidiaries, although this is not explicitly stated. This ambiguity necessitates further investigation to confirm their relationships and operational structures.

In terms of geographical presence, New York appears to be a significant hub for the company's activities, alongside its operations in the UK.</data>
