    <node id="Person">
      <data key="d0">Person</data>
      <data key="d1">name</data>
      <data key="d2">**Person**

A person, in general, refers to an individual human being. There are no specific characteristics or attributes that define a person beyond being a human entity. However, when considering the context of a person as an entity with specific roles or professions, several details come into play.

One notable aspect is the gender of a person, which can be male or female. In this sense, a person can identify as either male or female, and these distinctions are essential for understanding various social and cultural contexts. Furthermore, individuals may hold positions such as CEO (Chief Executive Officer), where they oversee an organization's operations and make strategic decisions.

In some cases, a person may also be an entrepreneur, serving as both the founder and CEO of their company. This role combines leadership and management responsibilities with the innovative aspect of entrepreneurship. Additionally, there are instances where individuals act as investors, providing financial support to various projects or ventures.

When considering personal details, age can vary greatly among individuals. Notably, John Smith is 30 years old, while others may be across a wide range of ages. Furthermore, some people may engage in politics, contributing their perspectives and expertise to the decision-making process at local, national, or international levels.

Notable examples of persons include individuals recognized for their professional achievements, such as being an American singer-songwriter. Specifically, John Smith has held multiple roles, including being hired as the new CEO of ABC Inc., serving as a software engineer and entrepreneur who serves as founder and CEO, and is also recognized as an artist.

Individuals like Larry Page and Sergey Brin have also held notable positions such as co-founder and CEO of Google, highlighting their accomplishments in the tech industry. It's worth noting that John Smith has also been referred to as the CEO of TechCorp and The CEO of ABC Inc., suggesting a level of professional versatility. Similarly, other individuals like John Doe are described as simply being human or male.

In addition to these roles, individuals may also be referred to by their profession, such as artist, curator, or singer-songwriter. Some examples include American singer-songwriters who have achieved significant success in the music industry. In terms of gender, both male and female individuals can hold these positions, with some notable examples including female artists and entrepreneurs.

Overall, a person can be defined by a wide range of characteristics and attributes, from their profession to their personal details such as age and gender. Whether they are an artist, CEO, or entrepreneur, each individual brings unique qualities and perspectives to the table, shaping their roles and responsibilities within various contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Software Engineer and Google Employee`&lt;SEP&gt;John Smith&lt;SEP&gt;Jane Doe&lt;SEP&gt;Michael&lt;SEP&gt;Emily&lt;SEP&gt;Male</data>
