    <node id="Sundar Pichai">
      <data key="d0">Sundar Pichai</data>
      <data key="d1">ceo</data>
      <data key="d2">Sundar Pichai, the current CEO of Google, has been instrumental in shaping the company's vision and direction. As a seasoned leader, he has overseen numerous initiatives and partnerships that have further solidified Google's position as a technology giant.

Pichai took over as CEO from Larry Page in 2015 and has since led the company through significant transformations, including the development of Android smartphones and Google Home smart speakers. Under his leadership, Google has continued to innovate and expand its product offerings, with a focus on artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning.

Interestingly, there was an instance where Sundar Pichai had collaborated with Microsoft, although details about their specific collaboration are unclear due to the missing information in the provided description. Nevertheless, this highlights the company's commitment to working with industry partners to drive growth and innovation.

It is worth noting that some descriptions mention him as CEO of Google multiple times, but these repetitions do not add any new information beyond what has been stated above. Similarly, a description mentions "en" without context, which appears to be an abbreviation or code rather than a complete description.

Overall, Sundar Pichai's tenure at the helm of Google has been marked by significant achievements and milestones that have further cemented his position as one of the most influential leaders in the tech industry.&lt;SEP&gt;CEO of Google&lt;SEP&gt;Google&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft` (missing field - "collaborated with" instead of "led by")</data>
