    <node id="ABC Inc.">
      <data key="d0">ABC Inc.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">ABC Inc. is a multinational corporation with its primary operations based in New York City, which serves as its listed location in some sources. The company's official language is English, as stated on multiple occasions.

Notably, ABC Inc.'s classification as a multinational corporation underscores its extensive global reach and influence. This categorization aligns with its operational scope, encompassing various geographical regions beyond New York City. As an organization based in New York City, ABC Inc. operates globally, reflecting the characteristics of a multinational entity.

The repetition of New York City and English descriptions may indicate differing data points or inconsistent labeling rather than distinct entities within ABC Inc. However, these details collectively contribute to an understanding of the company's foundational characteristics: it operates globally, with a significant presence in one of the world's major financial hubs where English is the dominant language.

It's worth noting that while some sources list ABC Inc.'s official location as New York City and its official language as English, this may not be universally consistent across all data points. Nevertheless, these characteristics provide a comprehensive overview of the company's operational scope and global influence as a multinational corporation.</data>
