      <data key="d2">The Address entity, specifically referring to a geographical location within the United States, is commonly associated with New York City. This city, located in the state of New York, serves as a hub for various cultural, economic, and social activities.

In more technical terms, an address can be represented as "city=New York", denoting its affiliation with this particular metropolis. Furthermore, when referring to geographical coordinates or postal services, addresses might also incorporate other details such as street names, building numbers, or zip codes.

