      <data key="d2">Acquired_by refers to the entity or relation where one company or organization gains control, ownership, or majority shares of another. This can occur through mergers, acquisitions, partnerships, or other forms of business combinations.

The acquired_by relationship is often seen in the context of Android, an open-source mobile operating system developed by Google. In this instance, Google acquired several companies and assets related to Android, including Android itself, which was initially developed by Android Inc. before being acquired by Google in 2005.

In a separate context, XYZ Inc., a fictional company for demonstration purposes, may have undergone an acquisition or merger, resulting in its current status as acquired_by another entity.&lt;SEP&gt;YouTube</data>
